@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Hello, world!</h1>

Welcome to your new app.


<div class="m-8 max-w-sm overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-900 p-6 text-white shadow-2xl transition-all hover:scale-105">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <div class="h-3 w-3 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-emerald-400 uppercase">Tailwind v4 Active</span>
    </div>
    <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Setup Complete!</h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        If you see a dark rounded card with green glowing accents and a hover effect, your styles are compiling correctly.
    </p>
    <button class="mt-5 w-full rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow hover:bg-emerald-500 transition-colors">
        Test Button
    </button>
</div>